<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In GREAT: Generalizable Backdoor Attacks in RLHF via Emotion-Aware Trigger Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Pseudocode of Our Attack Pipeline</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In GREAT: Generalizable Backdoor Attacks in RLHF via Emotion-Aware Trigger Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Harmfulness in a Multi-Turn Scenario</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In GREAT: Generalizable Backdoor Attacks in RLHF via Emotion-Aware Trigger Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Encoder-Target Model Mismatch Scenario</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
